Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.63,0:00:04.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Welcome to Uwe Manor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.63,0:00:07.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have to say, you kids must have\Na couple of screws loose
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.33,0:00:08.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,to come all the way up into the mountains here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.42,0:00:12.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This mansion's owner is Mr. Uwe Appel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.46,0:00:15.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The Appels family has been involved with\Nthe Republic's government for generations,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.04,0:00:19.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and Mr. Uwe is currently the vice-minister\Nof the Ministry of Health and Welfare.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.00,0:00:23.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, you want jobs to work while\Nyour seminary school is on break?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.58,0:00:26.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, you have letters of recommendation\Nfrom a local politician,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.71,0:00:28.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so I trust you're well-versed in etiquette.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.88,0:00:30.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please, don't think of us as students.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.71,0:00:32.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We can handle any task you deem fit to assign us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.96,0:00:35.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to working with you, Ms. Head Maid!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.29,0:00:36.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, that sounds far too fancy for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.50,0:00:38.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please, just call me Olivia.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.96,0:00:39.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,By the way...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.71,0:00:44.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,why's she been glaring at the mirror this whole time?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.21,0:00:46.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I look fuckin' ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.42,0:01:15.54,Song,,0,0,0,,Embrace the toll of pain
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.54,0:01:22.83,Song,,0,0,0,,The scabs that will never fade
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.83,0:01:28.21,Song,,0,0,0,,That day, a forceful draft snatched it away
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.21,0:01:32.83,Song,,0,0,0,,Unable to change, I have to leave it behind
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.13,0:01:38.04,Song,,0,0,0,,Come, outrace your fear
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.04,0:01:41.42,Song,,0,0,0,,Face the unfamiliar sky and day on your own two feet
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.42,0:01:44.29,Song,,0,0,0,,And greet the sunrise
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.75,0:01:47.33,Song,,0,0,0,,Misfortune gave rise to happiness
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.33,0:01:50.08,Song,,0,0,0,,You saw a guidepost at the end of despair
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.08,0:01:55.38,Song,,0,0,0,,And now, it's lit with a single flame
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.38,0:01:57.79,Song,,0,0,0,,Shake off the entangled past
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.79,0:02:05.71,Song,,0,0,0,,And fight until you find a place your heart can soar
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.71,0:02:11.58,Song,,0,0,0,,Ah, surviving through each moment
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.46,0:02:23.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The Impossible Mission Lamplight's\Nbeen assigned this time around
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.96,0:02:28.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,is to hunt down an Imperial assassin who's\Ninfiltrated the Din Republic's borders.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.04,0:02:33.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be selecting four\Nstrongest people among you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.38,0:02:36.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and taking those and only those members along\Nwith me when I set out for the mission tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.83,0:02:40.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You've split your duties evenly among you until now,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.92,0:02:44.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and I'm aware that doing so has\Nallowed you all to grow stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.50,0:02:47.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,However, I apologize, but I can't\Ntake all of you with me this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.63,0:02:51.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I mean, I guess it makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.92,0:02:55.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He's worried about what'll happen\Nif he delegates missions to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.54,0:02:59.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then again, if he keeps doing 'em solo,\Nhe's gonna hit his breaking point.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.00,0:03:03.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In other words, taking along the best four of us...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.75,0:03:06.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...is a pretty logical decision, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.04,0:03:09.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Still, it's a bummer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.67,0:03:11.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Feels like it's gonna make things\Nkind of awkward around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.00,0:03:14.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Who do you think the four are gonna be?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.79,0:03:17.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well obviously, the team's beautiful leader\NYours Truly is gonna be at the top of the list-
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.92,0:03:19.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, but seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.04,0:03:22.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, Monika's gotta be a shoo-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.42,0:03:25.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Out of all of us on the Operations squad,\Nshe's our unbeatable star player.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.79,0:03:29.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,At this rate, you and me are just\Ngonna end up holding down the fort.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.08,0:03:31.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sure feels that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.71,0:03:34.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh? What're you doin', Sara?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.38,0:03:37.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Me and Sybilla are on cooking duty today, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.50,0:03:39.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Teach asked me to.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.04,0:03:43.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He and Miss Grete are neck-deep\Nin a strategy meeting right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.50,0:03:45.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Dang, you don't see that every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.29,0:03:49.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Usually, Teach always cooks his own food.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.71,0:03:53.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I guess the mission's really keepin' him busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.42,0:03:55.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is our chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.17,0:03:56.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll grab the poison!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.21,0:03:57.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll get the restraining wire!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.08,0:04:02.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Your teamwork is impressive, but you really\Nneed to think these things over more!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.38,0:04:06.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The question is, what's the best way\Nfor the three of us to poison him?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.71,0:04:08.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see I've become an accomplice...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.04,0:04:13.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Look, Sara, this is our last chance to get chosen!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.42,0:04:19.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thinking back, he's never gone for\Nany of the food or drinks we poisoned before.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.38,0:04:21.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What if we coated it onto his utensils?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.50,0:04:22.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I dunno...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.13,0:04:26.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We could make the food super bland,\Nthen poison the condiments!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.25,0:04:28.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You really think that'd work?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.83,0:04:30.54,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,This looks like it could be interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.88,0:04:33.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They sound kind of desperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.29,0:04:34.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.71,0:04:36.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're just tryin' to poison his food, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.63,0:04:39.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I feel like we're missing the most obvious option.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.25,0:04:41.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.83,0:04:44.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All we gotta do is make super damn tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.42,0:04:50.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sara, I know I've been hiding it, but I'm secretly a klutz.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.79,0:04:51.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.54,0:04:54.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,For example, I'm the kind of person who\Ncan know all the right answers on a test,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.92,0:04:57.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,then get zero points because\NI put them all in the wrong boxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.88,0:04:58.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.96,0:04:59.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But here's the difference!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.71,0:05:02.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This white-haired chick's the kind of person\Nwho'd take the test the right way
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.54,0:05:04.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and end up with zero points anyways!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.00,0:05:05.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now listen here, you little shit...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.42,0:05:08.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's the harm in giving it a try?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.79,0:05:10.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's see what you've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.79,0:05:11.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Trust me, this'll work.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.54,0:05:13.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Heck, if it doesn't, I'll even put on a strip show.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.92,0:05:15.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,With Sybilla as the star.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.04,0:05:16.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now where the hell do you get off-
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.29,0:05:18.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ooh, I'm looking forward to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.46,0:05:22.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, I do at least have a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.58,0:05:26.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I-is this...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.08,0:05:28.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,a recipe?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.83,0:05:32.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I saw Klaus cooking 'em for himself once.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.42,0:05:35.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I figured it might come in handy at some point,\Nso I watched him the whole time through.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.08,0:05:37.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If we follow that recipe to the word,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.67,0:05:41.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,we'll be able to whip up some magnificently tasty grub!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.46,0:05:45.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Instead of poisoning the food, we'll use\Nits magnificent flavor to get his guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.42,0:05:46.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's when we launch our ambush...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.63,0:05:48.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...and finish the job with some poisoned tea!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.88,0:05:54.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I apologize taking up your time like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.67,0:05:56.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you, that was magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.71,0:05:58.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It was delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.00,0:06:01.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Right? We've got more, so dig in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.21,0:06:03.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Lily, go make 'em some tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.13,0:06:04.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Aye aye, cap'n!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.38,0:06:06.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That sounds wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.54,0:06:08.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If I could be so bold, though,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.38,0:06:10.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,a little more seasoning would make it taste even better.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.33,0:06:20.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Try it. Consider this part of your training.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.17,0:06:26.38,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,It's so fuckin' good!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.54,0:06:28.79,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,You said it! It's like a whole new dish!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.96,0:06:30.13,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,It's not just my mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.13,0:06:32.33,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,My whole body is crying out in joy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.38,0:06:36.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is what happens when you eat too fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.38,0:06:38.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Th-thanks...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.33,0:06:39.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...a million.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.63,0:06:47.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Dammit, we followed the recipe to a T.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.25,0:06:48.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why didn't it work?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.46,0:06:50.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, I can't say I'm surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.46,0:06:53.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You have my condolences.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.25,0:06:55.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't forget about that strip show you owe us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.54,0:06:58.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll bring something to record it with, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.63,0:07:00.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I guess that's that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.88,0:07:03.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Looks like we're gonna be on house-sitting duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.50,0:07:07.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Man, and all I wanted was to go along\Nand hopefully help out a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.25,0:07:15.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't usually get bent so out of shape,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.67,0:07:18.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but I still can't believe that we were\Nthe four who got picked.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.21,0:07:21.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Grete was the one helpin' Klaus come up with the plan,\Nso that much checks out, but aside from that...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.92,0:07:24.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Monika was pissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.08,0:07:27.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How exactly did Tweedledumb\Nand Tweedledumber here get chosen
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.13,0:07:31.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,while I, the most competent person here,\Nended up having to stay home?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.17,0:07:36.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The boss has his reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.58,0:07:37.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now that we've been chosen,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.88,0:07:40.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,we'll have to work hard enough to make up\Nfor everyone who didn't make the cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.00,0:07:44.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're right. This is no time to be sulking\Nover havin' to wear a maid uniform.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.71,0:07:48.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You sure that picking us was the right call?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.08,0:07:50.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Would you rather I didn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.17,0:07:53.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Nah, I'm happy as hell. It's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.58,0:07:57.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This mission will have a special significance\Nfor you in particular.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.21,0:08:01.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That said, I know it's going to be dangerous,\Nso you don't have to go if you don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.42,0:08:05.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Y'know, for a guy as daring as you,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.17,0:08:07.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,you sure get cautious in a hurry\Nwhen it comes to your teammates.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.13,0:08:12.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, don't you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.00,0:08:14.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure we get this mission done!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.71,0:08:18.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I owe you a huge one for findin' me in that academy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.83,0:08:21.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Whatever expectations you got for me,\NI plan on blowing 'em outta the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.42,0:08:27.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wh-what in the world...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.96,0:08:29.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You kids are incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.88,0:08:31.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Not at all. We were just doing our jobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.17,0:08:33.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is our work to your liking?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.92,0:08:35.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You'd better believe it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.08,0:08:38.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why, you might actually be able\Nto hold your own against Mr. Uwe!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.38,0:08:39.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You honor us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.38,0:08:44.83,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,Our target's an assassin called Corpse.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.96,0:08:48.13,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,According to the Foreign Intelligence\NOffice's investigation,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.13,0:08:51.25,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,Corpse's next target is the guy who owns this mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.13,0:08:53.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It sounds like he's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.04,0:08:58.75,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,Our job is to pose as maids so we can protect the guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.92,0:09:03.42,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,then beat the shit outta Corpse when\Nthe bastard tries to go in for the kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.92,0:09:06.79,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,So far, everything's goin' golden!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.58,0:09:12.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Welcome home, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.63,0:09:14.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Who in the blazes are you people?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.38,0:09:16.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,These are your new maids.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.08,0:09:18.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I told you about them this morning, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.33,0:09:22.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I thought you might've gone and brought\Nyour little sisters to work or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.75,0:09:24.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They look like a bunch of wet-behind-the-ear children.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.83,0:09:26.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please, take another look.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.46,0:09:28.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,See how they all have different color hair than me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.63,0:09:30.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.58,0:09:32.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Olivia, bring it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.04,0:09:34.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Again with this, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.25,0:09:35.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and bring it to me already!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.92,0:09:37.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're wasting time!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.88,0:09:44.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Two of my close politician friends recently died\Nunder suspicious circumstances.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.92,0:09:49.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've been trying to figure out\Nwhere the killer might be lurking...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.08,0:09:54.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but now, you've finally shown your faces!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.29,0:10:01.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hmph. So, you're just a bunch of ordinary little girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.63,0:10:03.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But remember this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.04,0:10:06.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If I see you acting the slightest bit suspiciously,\NI won't hesitate to shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.00,0:10:09.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This geezer's a nutjob.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.71,0:10:11.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You there, with the white hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.71,0:10:13.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Your test will be to make me dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.96,0:10:15.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,R-right away, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.83,0:10:23.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I apologize for the wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.79,0:10:26.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I made you beef pot-au-feu with\Ntendon meat and organic vegetables.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.46,0:10:31.29,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,I have to cook all the time as part of my training.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.29,0:10:32.75,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,Whipping that up was child's-
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.13,0:10:37.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Any maid who cooks this poorly
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.13,0:10:38.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,is a waste of space!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.88,0:10:44.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Something has felt off about the mansion\Never since we started working here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.38,0:10:50.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The rooms are kept terribly dark, and aside from\Nthe three of us, the only people who live here
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.83,0:10:56.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,are Mr. Uwe himself, his mother, his wife,\NOlivia the head maid,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.21,0:10:59.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and his live-in personal secretary.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.88,0:11:01.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's only five people.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.96,0:11:03.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And the entire place is strangely barren.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.92,0:11:04.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,From my understanding,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.79,0:11:08.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,houses belonging to generational members of parliament\Nare generally much more extravagant.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.29,0:11:10.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Damn, you really know your stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.00,0:11:14.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,To be honest, I actually come\Nfrom a politician's family myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.08,0:11:15.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,For real?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.54,0:11:17.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Even compared to the other people I met in those circles,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.17,0:11:20.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,this mansion's owner seems exceptionally\Ncurmudgeonly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.83,0:11:24.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Given his hatred of wastefulness, he could\Nvery well fire his entire maid staff at any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.75,0:11:26.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wasn't expecting this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.33,0:11:28.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This ain't like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.67,0:11:30.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You should be running circles around that geezer-
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.33,0:11:31.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The truth is
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.54,0:11:36.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,when I have to talk to men besides the boss,\Nit gives me a stomachache.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.67,0:11:37.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sorry, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.38,0:11:39.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm terribly sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.58,0:11:40.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't sweat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.17,0:11:44.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In that case, I'll handle the old man in your stead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.25,0:11:47.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, Sybilla!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.50,0:11:48.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.96,0:11:50.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is barely a speed bump.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.75,0:11:54.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's all put our skills together\Nand make this mission a success!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.67,0:12:03.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hold it, Silver!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.50,0:12:05.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That pillowcase is still perfectly functional!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.38,0:12:06.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Throwing it out would be a waste!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.71,0:12:07.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.13,0:12:09.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You too, Red!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.75,0:12:12.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can't take it. You'll have to excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.38,0:12:14.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,White, your cooking sucks!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.42,0:12:17.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How many times do I have to tell you to stop wasting\Ningredients before it gets through to you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.21,0:12:24.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,At the end of the day, our job's\Nto protect the damn guy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.96,0:12:28.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why don't we just tell him that\Nwe're here as his bodyguards?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.29,0:12:29.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's not an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.67,0:12:32.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Cunning politician or not, he's still a layman.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.25,0:12:35.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He's liable to accidentally leak intel to our foe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.29,0:12:40.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't forget that Corpse may already have\Ngotten close to Mr. Uwe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.92,0:12:41.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.96,0:12:46.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sara and I are going to continue gathering intel\Nand providing backup from nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.71,0:12:49.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you three\Nto handle things inside the mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.13,0:12:59.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you starting to get used to things around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.25,0:13:01.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I am. Thank you for asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.83,0:13:02.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm turning in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.21,0:13:04.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your hard work today.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.13,0:13:22.13,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,I need to find some sorta blackmail material\Nso I can keep the old bastard under control.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.67,0:13:24.13,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,He went in for a physical?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.63,0:13:26.38,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,I didn't take him for the type.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.25,0:13:31.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is this...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.75,0:13:43.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mr. Uwe specializes in matters regarding welfare policy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.92,0:13:46.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,As I understand, he specializes\Nin exposing the rich and powerful
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.83,0:13:50.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and advocates for improving\Nconditions for the impoverished.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.13,0:13:52.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing in here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.29,0:14:00.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I-I thought it'd be educational...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.96,0:14:02.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're White, judging by your voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.25,0:14:07.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't be skulking around at night like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.00,0:14:10.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Nose to the grindstone, y'know?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.17,0:14:13.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's the file you were reading?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.13,0:14:14.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.17,0:14:19.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, I won't press you on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.83,0:14:26.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's a story I heard, back when I used\Nto frequent the nation's orphanages.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.17,0:14:27.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It must've been eight years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.04,0:14:32.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Back then, gangs took advantage\Nof the postwar chaos to run rampant.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.75,0:14:36.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And the Cannibals were the worst of them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.46,0:14:39.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Over in the capital, they committed\Nevery crime under the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.92,0:14:44.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But one day, their ringleader got arrested,\Nand the gang fell apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.92,0:14:46.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do you know how that happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.25,0:14:48.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Beats me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.63,0:14:52.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The ringleader's daughter secretly tipped the police off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.92,0:14:55.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It was an admirable deed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.46,0:14:57.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Even after all the violent abuse she suffered,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.92,0:15:02.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,she was still willing to turn the entire gang against her\Njust to protect her young brother and sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.13,0:15:06.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The siblings made it safely to an orphanage,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.25,0:15:08.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but soon after, the older girl ran off.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.58,0:15:11.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why're you telling me all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.00,0:15:17.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I just remembered that the daughter\Nwas a gallant girl with white hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.00,0:15:21.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If she's still alive, she'd be just about your age.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.04,0:15:24.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll overlook the fact you trespassed in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.71,0:15:27.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,However, all three of you are fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.21,0:15:28.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But you can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.04,0:15:32.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I hired you against my better judgement\Nas a favor to a politician friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.75,0:15:34.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but I just can't abide the waste of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.33,0:15:36.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want you out of here by morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.54,0:15:42.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,At least tell me this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.21,0:15:46.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you hate waste so much, why not sell this huge house?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.63,0:15:50.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's out in the middle of nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.79,0:15:52.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's barely worth anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.63,0:15:55.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you sure it's not 'cause being the countryside\Nmake it easier to spot assassins?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.71,0:15:58.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can't afford to die just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.25,0:16:02.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The nation's social services still need me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.25,0:16:08.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...and that's the long and short of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.21,0:16:11.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sorry. I screwed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.79,0:16:13.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But I want you to hear me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.13,0:16:18.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There was a while there where I lived in\Nan orphanage with my brother and sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.33,0:16:22.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The place was dead broke,\Nand for some reason, that just pissed me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.08,0:16:24.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's why I decided to become a spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.88,0:16:28.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wanted to change the world however I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.63,0:16:31.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Uwe and I have a lot in common.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.88,0:16:34.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Right now, I'm on top of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.58,0:16:39.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That punk Teach took my feelings into account.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.38,0:16:43.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wanna rise to the occasion, and I wanna keep Uwe safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.13,0:16:45.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please, I'm askin' you to lend me a hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.17,0:16:47.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It would be my pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.88,0:16:49.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.08,0:16:52.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How are we supposed to save our jobs, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.04,0:16:53.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are we back on the blackmail plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.96,0:16:57.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna cook him a meal that'll blow his socks off\Nand make him realize what a good maid I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.79,0:16:59.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Dang, the brute-force approach!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.50,0:17:02.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But I like it. It's such a Sybilla plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.92,0:17:12.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.50,0:17:14.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You know that's a state hospital, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.08,0:17:14.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.08,0:17:17.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I need you to send Bernard in through the vents.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.83,0:17:19.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll steal what I need while he makes a scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.54,0:17:21.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm code name Pandemonium -
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.25,0:17:24.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and it's time I cleaned 'em out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.33,0:17:31.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.96,0:17:33.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Didn't I fire you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.63,0:17:36.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wanted to thank you for last night before I went.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.17,0:17:38.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How insolent.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.71,0:17:41.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What do you think's gonna happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.54,0:17:46.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We did the food prep just like Sybilla asked\Nwhile we waited for her to get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.04,0:17:48.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All we can do now is trust in her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.29,0:17:51.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is vile!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.96,0:17:54.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's better than last time, but it's still inedible dreck!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.92,0:17:55.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, figures.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.92,0:17:56.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.25,0:17:59.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,These are the results from that physical you took.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.08,0:18:03.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Your red blood cell count is way below average.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.33,0:18:05.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's a telltale symptom of vitamin deficiency.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.33,0:18:07.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How did you get your hands on that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.17,0:18:10.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's giving you a taste disorder.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.17,0:18:13.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,On some level, you probably already realized it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.17,0:18:19.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,After the Great War, you started\Nsacrificing everything to economize.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.58,0:18:24.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In particular, you went around and gave supplies\Nto orphanages all around the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.04,0:18:26.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You even gave 'em the food off your own plate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.13,0:18:28.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So what if I did?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.33,0:18:29.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's a limit to how far you can go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.71,0:18:31.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Your body's not getting the nutrients it needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.42,0:18:34.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's what gave you that taste disorder.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.63,0:18:38.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You said that the dish I just made\Nwas better than the last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.54,0:18:41.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's because I loaded it chock-full of spices.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.50,0:18:44.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It was the smell you were reacting to, not the flavor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.29,0:18:46.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When you can't taste anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.83,0:18:49.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,you start preferring food that's heavily seasoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.04,0:18:52.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,At this rate, you're gonna put yourself in an early grave!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.46,0:18:53.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You need to hire us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.71,0:18:55.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You can't possibly call that a waste anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.75,0:18:59.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll make you nutritious food every day,\Nget you your sense of taste back,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.71,0:19:02.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and serve you a meal you can really enjoy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.54,0:19:04.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Little girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.25,0:19:10.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,don't go shooting your mouth off\Nlike you know everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.50,0:19:13.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Nice, that went well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.08,0:19:16.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,At least we managed to save two of the jobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.88,0:19:18.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why did you volunteer to quit?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.58,0:19:20.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What choice did I have? I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.38,0:19:26.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This nation still has scores of people who get nothing\Nto eat each day but a single scrap of bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.96,0:19:32.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,As someone who works in social welfare,\Nwhat kind of example would I be setting to the world
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.08,0:19:34.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,if I went and hired three new maids?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.71,0:19:39.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...after he went and said all that, I had to at least\Ncompromise by letting him drop one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.63,0:19:43.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Besides, I can't even take the credit for our win.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.00,0:19:48.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All I did was copy you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.88,0:19:51.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You didn't just modify the food to suit our tastes,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.58,0:19:54.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,you seasoned each plate based\Non our individual nutritional states.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.88,0:19:58.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's what made 'em taste so damn good, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.63,0:20:01.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sure, I got fired, but I'll bounce back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.04,0:20:03.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can swap to a supporting role and help the mission by-
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.08,0:20:04.13,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Was that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.13,0:20:04.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.29,0:20:09.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Was Mr. Uwe's only symptom the taste disorder\Ncaused by his malnutrition?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.29,0:20:11.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What do you...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.92,0:20:14.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please, take another look.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.75,0:20:16.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,See how they all have different color hair than me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.13,0:20:18.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're White, judging by your voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.50,0:20:20.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.88,0:20:22.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He's got nyctalopia?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.50,0:20:26.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Night blindness, as it's often called, is a condition\Nwhere one's vision declines dramatically in the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.54,0:20:28.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And it's caused...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.63,0:20:31.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...by vitamin deficiencies, the same as the taste disorder.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.79,0:20:36.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mr. Uwe does his own driving,\Nbut he should probably give that a rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.42,0:20:41.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Given the circumstances, he can't possibly\Nthink of hiring a driver as wasteful.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.25,0:20:48.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Welcome back, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.13,0:20:51.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Your blasted driving is too wasteful.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.13,0:20:53.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Can't you steer any more gently?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.46,0:20:54.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wow, rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.79,0:20:56.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll have you know I've got\Na perfectly good driver's license.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.54,0:20:58.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's fake, but I've got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.13,0:21:00.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.17,0:21:01.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.83,0:21:04.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,C'mon, watch your step.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.33,0:21:10.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.21,0:21:11.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.25,0:21:24.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Damn you, killer!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.13,0:21:31.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We'll go after him!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.75,0:21:32.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.42,0:21:34.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You and the head maid should get inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.38,0:21:35.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Call the cops, fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.63,0:21:51.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.08,0:21:57.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The assassin's finally made his move.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.46,0:22:00.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sybilla and Lily, you two should prepare yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.92,0:22:14.46,Song,,0,0,0,,I've been watching the night as it pours on down
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.46,0:22:17.13,Song,,0,0,0,,Even as it gets closer and closer
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.13,0:22:19.38,Song,,0,0,0,,(Give it up, give it up)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.71,0:22:23.33,Song,,0,0,0,,If I quietly gave you my secret name
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.33,0:22:29.00,Song,,0,0,0,,I could vanish into the dark to avoid being found
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.58,0:22:40.25,Song,,0,0,0,,I've forgotten all about those secret tears I shed
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.25,0:22:43.75,Song,,0,0,0,,Like my cells all got replaced
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.75,0:22:46.13,Song,,0,0,0,,I'm a different person now
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.46,0:22:49.83,Song,,0,0,0,,So let's frolic our way through these busy days
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.83,0:22:52.63,Song,,0,0,0,,I kind of want to talk to you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.63,0:22:54.88,Song,,0,0,0,,But everyone is gone
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.88,0:22:58.63,Song,,0,0,0,,That's not what it means
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.63,0:23:02.08,Song,,0,0,0,,To make someone a promise
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.13,0:23:07.67,Song,,0,0,0,,I've been watching the night as it pours on down
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.67,0:23:10.50,Song,,0,0,0,,Even as it gets closer and closer
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.50,0:23:12.75,Song,,0,0,0,,(Give it up, give it up)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.04,0:23:16.71,Song,,0,0,0,,If I quietly gave you my secret name
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.71,0:23:21.88,Song,,0,0,0,,I could vanish into the dark to avoid being found
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.88,0:23:23.33,Song,,0,0,0,,And when we're born again
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.33,0:23:25.67,Song,,0,0,0,,Flying through a new night sky
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.67,0:23:30.25,Song,,0,0,0,,We intersect again and again
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.42,0:23:31.92,Song,,0,0,0,,Standing on level stars
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.92,0:23:34.46,Song,,0,0,0,,And gazing straight into each other's eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.46,0:23:39.17,Song,,0,0,0,,I want to give it to you when we meet again
